From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:27:45 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 64/69] net: wireless: samsung: scsc: import 4.14 WLAN driver
 sources verbatim

Import, unmodified, the station-mode subset of the Samsung SCSC Wi-Fi
driver as a reference base for the 6.18 forward-port. Source: A50
baseline kernel, branch halium-a50-aa17rf2, commit 4f37ef39
(drivers/net/wireless/scsc), matching driver 11.19.0.18.0 and stock
firmware S620_E9610_R3-1_Y21W46A.

Sources: HIP4 transport, mbulk, device/netdev/cfg80211 glue, RX/TX, block
ack, SAP handlers, MIB, MLME/management, flow control, private ioctls,
procfs, regulatory, the UDI debug device and test SAPs, plus all headers
of the directory. Not imported: GSCAN/NAN vendor commands, the
wifilogger, HIP4 sampler, smapper, ACM API and KIC. Moved from
drivers/net/wireless/scsc to the vendor directory samsung/scsc. Nothing
is built yet: Kconfig and Makefile come with the 6.18 adaptation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: If36f39137657aab2cd1a081a7f55b172ae802811
